    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Dixon Residential Estate Agents are delighted to present 54 Barnwall Court to the Balbriggan property market.\r\n\r\nThis beautifully presented two-bedroom, three-bathroom duplex apartment offers an excellent opportunity for first-time buyers and investors alike.\r\n\r\nUpon entering, you are welcomed by a spacious hallway leading to a bright and airy open-plan living and dining area, featuring impressive floor-to-ceiling windows that flood the space with natural light. This inviting area seamlessly connects to the kitchen, creating an ideal setting for both everyday living and entertaining. A guest WC completes the ground floor accommodation.\r\n\r\nUpstairs, the property boasts a generous master bedroom with a modern en-suite bathroom, along with a well-proportioned second bedroom. Both bedrooms benefit from direct access to a private balcony. A family bathroom completes the first-floor accommodation.\r\n\r\nThe property enjoys a highly convenient location, just minutes a wide range of amenities and services, including Dunnes Stores, a medical centre, pharmacy, convenience stores, hair salon, cafés and restaurants. The area offers an excellent selection of leisure and recreational attractions, including sandy beaches, Balbriggan Harbour and Ardgillan Castle, with its stunning parklands. Sporting enthusiasts are also well catered for, with a variety of golf, GAA, football, rugby and cricket clubs nearby.\r\n\r\nConnectivity is excellent, with the M1 Motorway just a five-minute drive away, providing easy access to Dublin Airport, the Dublin Port Tunnel and Dublin City Centre. Balbriggan Railway Station is also within walking distance, offering regular commuter services to Dublin City and surrounding areas.\r\n\r\nOverall, 54 Barnwall Court presents an excellent opportunity to acquire a spacious and well-located duplex apartment in a popular and well-connected development.\r\n\r\nDisclaimer: All details are provided to the best of our knowledge. While we strive for accuracy, some information may have been provided by the vendor. We are not liable for any mistakes, errors or inaccuracies in our online advertising, and we advise all interested parties to seek professional advice regarding any concerns."
      },
